# Homepage-specific, NON-SECRET config. This file IS committed.
#
# Shared values (PUID/PGID/TZ/CONFIG_ROOT/DATA_ROOT/ADMIN_DOMAIN) live in
# ../../common.env.
#
# Every API key and password is a Komodo secret Variable, injected as a
# HOMEPAGE_VAR_* environment variable by compose.yaml and substituted into
# config/*.yaml at runtime as {{HOMEPAGE_VAR_NAME}}. See
# komodo/resources/stacks.toml for the full list and where each value is read
# from.
#
# The dashboard layout itself is NOT secret and lives in config/, committed,
# so a rebuild is a `git push` rather than an afternoon of clicking.

# Nothing else Homepage-specific needed yet.
